# M7 online: the host leaves mid-session (co-op). The others regroup in a
# new room around the lowest remaining machine and play on; the new host
# ends the session and both agree.
size 1280x720
# The first launch plays the intro: hold a key to skip it.
wait 150
hold enter 70
idle 400
@host online host private ${ROOMFILE}
@m1 online join code ${ROOMFILE}
@!m0,m1 online join invite ${ROOMFILE}
@host online wait 90 machines=${MACHINES}
@host online mode coop
online seats ${LOCALS}
online wait 90 online session
online wait 60 players=${PLAYERS}
online bots 4
online settle 30
@host online leave
@host online wait 30 menu=Online
@host quit
online wait 90 machines=2
online wait 60 players=4
shot 01-migrated
online bots 4
online settle 60
online end-if-host
online wait 90 online room
online expect agreed
quit
